{"key":"5ad995a62d60226f","source_file":"Potts Hi - Hy.json","source_id":57331,"source_url":"concordance-hump-ppl-gibbus","term":"Hump","headwords":["Hump","Humped"],"latin":["Gibbus","Gibbosus"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Hump"],"latin":["Gibbus"]},{"english":["Humped"],"latin":["Gibbosus"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","DLW","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"2781","subsection":"2"},"text":"Upon the hump of camels (). Explained.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLW","section":"432","subsection":"2"},"text":"This Primitive in its higher gibbous part... DWis 3. 4.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLW","section":"432","subsection":null},"text":"The gibbous part was a very thin membrane...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLW","section":"432","subsection":null},"text":"The gibbous part, which was a type of the brain in leasts, was also divided as it were into two protuberances.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"269","subsection":"2"},"text":"If the love of the world makes the head, the man is... humped.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"432","subsection":"2"},"text":"Their bodies appear as it were humped.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"404","subsection":"end"},"text":"Looked at from Heaven such a man appears like a humped man, walking with his head bent down and looking at the earth...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"4626","subsection":null},"text":"Some (devils) appear enormously humped.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"hump","url":"/meta/potts/hump/"}